; Import definitions for the ntdll.dll functions the fixtures call directly.
;
; mingw-w64 ships libntdll.a, but it does not export these for import, so `__declspec(dllimport)`
; fails to link. dlltool turns this list into an import library that produces real IAT entries -
; which is exactly what the patcher needs to see (a `call [rip+disp]` to an import slot rather
; than an indirect call through a GetProcAddress result).
;
;   x86_64-w64-mingw32-dlltool -d ntdll.def -l libntdll_imp.a -k
LIBRARY ntdll.dll
EXPORTS
NtQueryInformationProcess
NtRaiseHardError
RtlSetProcessIsCritical
